{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XmQEI-vViZH40AM42Eqhmw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:41.745651+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XmQEI-vViZH40AM42Eqhmw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w2M3u3VfJObNEQvfQbQnlSQgDNkGUqL2dXjqtgffaYXE7C9ib3A13bFnw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进国内各高校优秀大学生相互交流，近距离了解安徽医科大学卫生管理学院的学科优势、人才培养、就业前景以及本学科领域的研究前沿，学院举办2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动，欢迎有意攻读我院研究生的优秀学子积极报名参加。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w2wbP1e9oqE6NIhibseNYvEnhplqwKdaQk0UReIPJjU1Ne1YhtMQd5BpQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、单位简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w236Ehlz0ylP1TuOunaic0oy85OMvwwtv93nB13s4WibMl5lPFN3iaJ1XQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>安徽医科大学卫生管理学院的前身是1980年成立的安徽医学院农村卫生事业管理研究室，是我国第一所卫生管理学院，目前也是全国卫生管理教育办学规模最大的学院之一。学院秉承“运筹、务实、求同、创新”院训，致力培养一流卫生管理人才。学院设有社会医学与卫生事业管理学二级学科博士学位点和公共管理一级学科硕士学位点。全院现有教职工76人，其中博士生导师4人、硕士生导师42人。学院拥有安徽省高校智库、安徽医科大学安徽省医疗保障研究院、安徽医科大学医院管理研究所三个科研平台。获得省学术技术带头人、省级教坛新秀、省级教学名师等多项荣誉称号。近五年发表SCI/SSCI论文150余篇，获得国家级项目立项13项，各级各类科研项目到账总经费达1500万元。近五年，研究生就业率均为100%</span></span><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w20j1FFaIjLZxhGodSSuS8EDyuuP9WGicNUnA6hfX3KsbInia9yjsooAibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、报名时间  </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w236Ehlz0ylP1TuOunaic0oy85OMvwwtv93nB13s4WibMl5lPFN3iaJ1XQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月2日至2025年7月6日</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w20j1FFaIjLZxhGodSSuS8EDyuuP9WGicNUnA6hfX3KsbInia9yjsooAibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><sectio