ection><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w236Ehlz0ylP1TuOunaic0oy85OMvwwtv93nB13s4WibMl5lPFN3iaJ1XQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.材料清单</span></p><p><span>（1）《安徽医科大学卫生管理学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（见附件1）</span></p><p><span>（2）现有本科阶段成绩单（需显示截至目前所有课程成绩，且需有教务部门或学院盖章）</span></p><p><span>（3）其他证明材料（荣誉证书、科研经历、社会实践、科研成果等）</span></p><p><span>2.审核与入营确认</span></p><p><span>学院将根据申请者提交的材料，以学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等为主要评价依据进行评审，审核通过者将于2025年7月7日前以邮件或电话形式通知，入选者需回复“确认参加”或“确认不参加”，未在规定时间内回复者视为放弃。未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w20j1FFaIjLZxhGodSSuS8EDyuuP9WGicNUnA6hfX3KsbInia9yjsooAibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、学生食宿及资助安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjVaypsgBwbCPSib3QaYdO5w236Ehlz0ylP1TuOunaic0oy85OMvwwtv93nB13s4WibMl5lPFN3iaJ1XQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></secti